        "claims": "Two op-amps (SPEC-004 opamp) at the datasheet's typical open-loop gain, a single pole at its gain-bandwidth, its slew rate, and its output headroom to each rail; fixtures for a follower, the positive headroom, the slew rate and the bandwidth from those values.",
